OL,3,GNEWSACare provider left people without
OL,4,Afood - CQC
OL,5,
OL,6,FStaff at a Surrey care provider ignored
OL,7,Fpatients and left them without food and
OL,8,Fdrink for longer than they should, a
OL,9,Fwatchdog has said.
OL,11,FThe Care Quality Commission (CQC) said
OL,12,Fcarers at Silverjen Limited - which
OL,13,Fassists clients in their own homes `
OL,14,Fhad left people feeling "unsafe", and
OL,15,Fone case was highlighted where a person
OL,16,Fwas handled roughly and left in pain.
OL,18,FThe CQC added that the
OL,19,FLeatherhead-based agency was also
OL,20,Fadministering sedatives without proper
OL,21,Frecord-keeping or oversight.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
